{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, and create it at launch.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Add the package","type":"heading","anchor":"Add-the-package"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"text":", at the release","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose documentation you’re reading. In ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"<version>\")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links a binary framework, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":", which SwiftPM checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Register the wallet","type":"heading","anchor":"Register-the-wallet"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app’s Info.plist (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleURLTypes"},{"text":"), and pass the URL the app receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the issuance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificates: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRoots"},{"text":" for credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because it sent the offer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Provide the keys and the storage","type":"heading","anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key — the one a credential copy is bound to — signs when presenting, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Credential Request’s proof when receiving or refreshing. By default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode each time: add an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" describes the trade-off.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". The app and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extension then share one store: a store of your own implements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" atomically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"across both processes, as ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" does with a file","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lock.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","type":"heading","anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation request also names the issuance’s instance key, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"walletAttestation"},{"text":" attested first, so your backend can give the Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation that key’s status. A real Wallet Provider attests only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    \/\/ instanceKey is the issuance's, which walletAttestation sent first.","    func keyAttestation(instanceKey: Data, keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appendingPathComponent(path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Create the wallet","type":"heading","anchor":"Create-the-wallet"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle of leaves its keys behind. Each trust role whose roots you set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needs a revocation choice: checked against the CRLs your app fetches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"), or declined","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"); see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, crls: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots,","            crls: crls,","            revocation: [.issuer, .status, .verifier])","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Ship the release build","anchor":"Ship-the-release-build"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links the release build of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" says which one an app has,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Getting started","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","title":"network","abstract":[{"text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform","title":"platform","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"platform","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message follows."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/revocation":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/revocation","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"revocation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevocationRole","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCW